# Progress — 2026-09-03 (b): Step 2 done — corpus + datalab rebuilt

## Corpus (new `preprocess/` package)
- `preprocess/build_corpus.py` — 61 xlsx (998,020) -> `news_corpus.parquet` **931,709 rows**
  2021-01 ~ 2026-07, 67 months, no gaps. Dropped: 53,194 bigkinds exclude flags,
  12,976 file-boundary dupes, 141 empty keyword rows. Dedup key = URL, fallback 일자|언론사|제목.
- `--audit` confirms NO file hits the 20,000 export cap. The 2023 2-month blocks
  (25,856~29,055 rows) are fine; the README cap warning is resolved.
- FINDING: `본문` is truncated to 200 chars in 92~97% of rows. Topic input must be the
  `키워드` column (bigkinds morpheme analysis of the FULL article), not 본문.
- LIMITATION (unresolved): only 3 outlets — 매일경제, 서울경제, 한국경제. All business dailies.
  Media-bias control from research_plan §6 is not achievable. Either add general dailies
  or narrow the claim to "경제지 기준 이슈 국면". Documented in plan §6 and README.

## Keyword mining (`preprocess/mine_keywords.py`)
- stages: df -> monthly -> topics (NMF 14 on 201,000 doc sample) / cluster (co-movement)
- Filters out calendar/number tokens; without that filter clusters were pure '3일/1월/1분기'.
- Topic shares: T6 규제 10.5, T7 수출제조 9.9, T3 소비유통 9.2, T1 거시 8.4,
  T10 AI반도체 7.9, T11 자본거래 7.8, T2 부동산 6.9, T13 대출은행 6.0 ...
- T10 (AI·반도체) is the biggest mover: 2022-09 trough -> 2026-06 peak 16.2%.

## Datalab rebuilt on corpus evidence
- Regimes 5 -> 7: 물가·금리·부동산·**가계대출**·**대외통상**·**AI반도체**·**증시실적**
  (dropped `성장` — no matching topic; split 가계대출 out of 금리 — different peaks)
- Request design changed: 1 target group + 1 anchor group (`은행`) per request.
  `score_rel = score / anchor_score` is comparable ACROSS requests.
  Anchor CV 0.185 was lowest of 8 candidates (경제 0.307, 주식 0.640).
  Verified: anchor shape identical across all 7 requests (max sd 1.2e-05 after mean-norm).
  Resolution fixed: 25 of 28 sub groups now peak at 100 (was: 근원물가 peaked at 0.09).
- Period pinned to config (2016-01-01 ~ 2026-07-31). Was `date.today()` = irreproducible.
- Daily: datalab omits below-threshold days entirely -> filled 0 (식료품물가 24d, 공급망 208d).
- Sanity: 금리 peaks 2022-11, 물가 spikes 2022-07, AI반도체 7 -> 102 by 2025-07,
  증시실적 490 by 2026-07 (matches the KOSPI run in ECOS). Level corr with corpus topics:
  AI반도체~T10 0.75, 대외통상~T10 0.72, 증시실적~T5 0.52, 금리~T1 0.45.
  MoM log-diff corr is weak (0.11~0.40) — search and news co-move in level, not month to month.
  That is an RQ4 finding, not a defect.

